.TH tuexpand 1 0.29.0 tclutils "Tcl Utility Command"
.SH NAME
tuexpand \- thin CLI wrapper for tclutils::tuexpand
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
tuexpand ?expand|unexpand? ?-tabs N? ?-all 0|1? ?file?
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The tuexpand command is a thin wrapper around the Tcl package tclutils::tuexpand. It is intended for interactive and scripting use when tclutils is installed from source. The primary API remains the Tcl library; see tuexpand(n) for procedures, options, and semantics.
.PP
Run the script with tclsh:
.PP
.nf
tclsh bin/tuexpand.tcl ...
.fi
